---
/** Fallback when Mi Guardia is not installed (Universal / App Links). */
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Open in Mi Guardia</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Someone shared a guardia rotation with you. Open it in Mi Guardia."
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light dark;
        --fg: #171616;
        --muted: #6b6560;
        --bg: #f6f1ec;
        --brand: #dc211e;
        --card: #fff;
      }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root {
          --fg: #f2f2f2;
          --muted: #aaa;
          --bg: #171616;
          --card: #242221;
        }
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100dvh;
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--fg);
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }
      main {
        width: min(24rem, 100%);
        background: var(--card);
        border-radius: 1.5rem;
        padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin: 0;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }
      p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      .actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
      }
      a.btn {
        display: block;
        text-align: center;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      }
      a.primary {
        background: var(--brand);
        color: #fff;
      }
      a.secondary {
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--fg);
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--muted) 40%, transparent);
      }
      .es {
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>Open in Mi Guardia</h1>
      <p>
        Someone shared a rotation schedule with you. Install or open Mi Guardia
        to review it and save it on your device.
      </p>
      <p class="es">
        Alguien compartió una rotación contigo. Instala o abre Mi Guardia para
        revisarla y guardarla en tu dispositivo.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a
          class="btn primary"
          href="https://apps.apple.com/search?term=Mi%20Guardia"
          >App Store</a
        >
        <a
          class="btn secondary"
          href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.alanmatias.guardias"
          >Google Play</a
        >
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
